-- evt:skull_endurance
RegisterEvent(48, "Skull", function()
    evt.SimpleMessage("Unprompted, the skull begins to speak: To make a potion of endurance, gather together the poisoned entrails of a toad kept under a cold stone for thirty-one days, a slice of swamp snake, the eye of a newt, the toe of a frog, wool from a bat, tongue of a dog, a lizard's leg, an owlet's wing, and the forked tongue of a snake. Throw them all in a cauldron and let sit under the auspices of a full moon. Begin boiling just before sunrise. Keep warm until sunrise of the next day. If the mixture turns black, the brew is sour and will turn its drinkers to stone. Makes one serving.")
end, "Skull")

-- evt:skull_personality
RegisterEvent(49, "Skull", function()
    evt.SimpleMessage("Unprompted, the skull begins to speak: To make a Potion of Personality, gather together the ground horn of a Unicorn, the tanned hide of an Ogre, and the blood of a monkeydog sacrificed 'neath the blackness of a new moon. Slowly pour a half part of the blood into a twenty gallon cauldron and mix in the horn powder. Heat to a low simmer and let sit for three days. At the stroke of midnight on the third night, drop the Ogre hide into the stew and stir rapidly. If the hide dissolves any sooner or later than three minutes, the brew is sour and will turn its drinkers to stone. Makes one serving.")
end, "Skull")

-- evt:skull_speed
RegisterEvent(50, "Skull", function()
    evt.SimpleMessage("Unprompted, the skull begins to speak: To make a potion of speed, gather together the claw of a roadrunner, the wing of a hummingbird, and the paw of a cheetah. Pound the claw to dust and sprinkle into briskly boiling salt water. Quickly drop in the wing, followed by the paw. Stir 100 times, rapidly. Remove the cauldron from the fire and pour the liquid through a strainer and into a second cauldron. If any material remains in the strainer, the brew is sour and will turn its drinkers to stone. Makes one serving.")
end, "Skull")

